      "claim": "Reads to shadowed configuration registers (addr_hit[5]) unconditionally present the current qs values, even when status_alert_recov_ctrl_update_err is asserted. The design intent is unclear: whether reads should be blocked or sanitized during a shadow update error to prevent consumption of corrupted security parameters.",
